{"data":"{\"include\":[\"reasoning.encrypted_content\"],\"input\":[{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"You are a coding assistant. Use the available tools to inspect facts before\\nclaiming results. Available skills: gui-debug, web-search.\\n\\nFor delegated work, ask questions with send_message_to_parent and answer child\\nquestions with respond_to_parent_message. Join or shut down unfinished children,\\nthen call submit with your completed result. Ordinary text does not submit work.\",\"type\":\"input_text\"}],\"role\":\"developer\",\"type\":\"message\"},{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Work only in /tmp/ch26-live-0N7L6h. Implement slugify.py with slugify(text) that lowercases and joins whitespace-separated words using hyphens; empty input returns empty string. Create a unittest file covering mixed case, repeated whitespace, and empty input. Inspect the directory first. Run python3 -m unittest -v in that directory and submit your actual measured result. Do not create any children. Do not browse or install packages. Use the inherited model.\",\"type\":\"input_text\"}],\"role\":\"user\",\"type\":\"message\"}],\"model\":\"gpt-6-astra\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"high\",\"summary\":\"auto\"},\"store\":false,\"stream\":true,\"tools\":[{\"description\":\"Ensemble local tools\",\"name\":\"ensemble\",\"tools\":[{\"description\":\"Report the selected model, last response and session token counts, cache hit rate and derived session USD cost (unknown when prices are unavailable).\",\"name\":\"agent_status\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{}},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Read text with one-based inclusive start_line/end_line. Optional max_bytes bounds the read; job reports cap inline output and preserve the full result on disk.\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"start_line\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"end_line\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"max_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"path\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"List immediate entries, sorted by name; directories end with /.\",\"name\":\"list_directory\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Search files recursively using a regular expression. context_lines defaults to zero. Output uses grep path:line:text and path-line-context with merged windows.\",\"name\":\"search_files\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"context_lines\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"pattern\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Write text, creating parent directories. Existing files require overwrite:true unless append:true. Append preserves existing content.\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"content\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"overwrite\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"append\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"content\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Replace one exact, unique old_text anchor with new_text. Zero or multiple matches refuse without changing the file; read and provide a more specific anchor.\",\"name\":\"edit_file\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"old_text\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"new_text\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"old_text\",\"new_text\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Start a fresh /bin/sh in a PTY. cwd applies only to this call, relative to the workspace. Merged output and exit_code stay on disk; a running report is a handle, not cancellation. ai_callback_delay is seconds (default 3); pattern matches unseen output; max_output_bytes defaults to 16384.\",\"name\":\"run_command\",\"