{"data":"{\"include\":[\"reasoning.encrypted_content\"],\"input\":[{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"You are a coding assistant. Use the available tools to inspect facts before\\nclaiming results. Available skills: gui-debug, web-search.\\n\\nFor delegated work, ask questions with send_message_to_parent and answer child\\nquestions with respond_to_parent_message. Join or shut down unfinished children,\\nthen call submit with your completed result. Ordinary text does not submit work.\",\"type\":\"input_text\"}],\"role\":\"developer\",\"type\":\"message\"},{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Work only in /tmp/ch26-live-0N7L6h. This is one small bounded coding task. Create exactly one child with agent_id helper and delegate implementing slugify.py with slugify(text) that lowercases and joins whitespace-separated words using hyphens (empty input returns empty string), plus a unittest file covering mixed case, repeated whitespace and empty input. The child must run python3 -m unittest -v and submit its actual result. Do not create further children. As parent use get_sub_agent_status and wait_for_agent_change to monitor helper, then join_agents and get_submission. Independently rerun the tests, write fleet-result.txt containing your measured test outcome, and submit a concise final result beginning CH26_LIVE_COMPLETE. Use the inherited model. Do not browse or install packages.\",\"type\":\"input_text\"}],\"role\":\"user\",\"type\":\"message\"},{\"arguments\":\"{\\\"agent_id\\\":\\\"helper\\\",\\\"task\\\":\\\"Work only in /tmp/ch26-live-0N7L6h. Implement slugify.py with slugify(text) that lowercases and joins whitespace-separated words using hyphens; empty input returns empty string. Create a unittest file covering mixed case, repeated whitespace, and empty input. Inspect the directory first. Run python3 -m unittest -v in that directory and submit your actual measured result. Do not create any children. Do not browse or install packages. Use the inherited model.\\\"}\",\"call_id\":\"call_9FYrlYV3kXzf7kyc9FdcHueI\",\"name\":\"spawn_sub_agent\",\"namespace\":\"ensemble\",\"type\":\"function_call\"},{\"call_id\":\"call_9FYrlYV3kXzf7kyc9FdcHueI\",\"output\":\"{\\\"activity\\\":{\\\"phase\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"input\\\":0,\\\"cache_write\\\":0,\\\"cache_read\\\":0,\\\"output\\\":0},\\\"agent_id\\\":\\\"helper\\\",\\\"state\\\":\\\"running\\\"}\",\"type\":\"function_call_output\"},{\"arguments\":\"{\\\"agent_id\\\":\\\"helper\\\"}\",\"call_id\":\"call_MjWDv23W6f02izk6N1F6G9RN\",\"name\":\"get_sub_agent_status\",\"namespace\":\"ensemble\",\"type\":\"function_call\"},{\"call_id\":\"call_MjWDv23W6f02izk6N1F6G9RN\",\"output\":\"{\\\"activity\\\":{\\\"phase\\\":\\\"thinking\\\"},\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"input\\\":1962,\\\"cache_write\\\":0,\\\"cache_read\\\":0,\\\"output\\\":29},\\\"agent_id\\\":\\\"helper\\\",\\\"state\\\":\\\"running\\\"}\",\"type\":\"function_call_output\"}],\"model\":\"gpt-6-astra\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"high\",\"summary\":\"auto\"},\"store\":false,\"stream\":true,\"tools\":[{\"description\":\"Ensemble local tools\",\"name\":\"ensemble\",\"tools\":[{\"description\":\"Report the selected model, last response and session token counts, cache hit rate and derived session USD cost (unknown when prices are unavailable).\",\"name\":\"agent_status\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{}},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Read text with one-based inclusive start_line/end_line. Optional max_bytes bounds the read; job reports cap inline output and preserve the full result on disk.\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"start_line\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"end_line\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"max_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"path\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"List immediate entries, sorted by name; directories end with /.\",\"name\":\"list_directory\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Search files recursively using a regular expression. context_lines defaults to zero. Output uses grep path:line:text and path-line-context with merged windows.\",\"name\":\"search_files\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"context_lines\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"pattern\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Write text, creating parent directories. Existing files require overwrite:true unless append:true. Append preserves existing content.\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"content\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"overwrite\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"append\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"content\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Replace one exact, unique old_text anchor with new_text. Zero or multiple matches refuse without changing the file; read and provide a more specific anchor.\",\"name\":\"edit_file\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"old_text\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"new_text\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"old_text\",\"new_text\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Start a fresh /bin/sh in a PTY. cwd applies only to this call, relative to the workspace. Merged output and exit_code stay on disk; a running report is a handle, not cancellation. ai_callback_delay is seconds (default 3); pattern matches unseen output; max_output_bytes defaults to 16384.\",\"name\":\"run_command\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"command\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"cwd\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"ai_callback_delay\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Seconds before looking again, defa