"string\"}},\"required\":[\"agent_id\",\"task\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Wait for the listed children to submit; an empty list means all children. Returns early with pending questions: answer using respond_to_parent_message, then join again. A running job report is not completion.\",\"name\":\"join_agents\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"agent_ids\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"ai_callback_delay\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Seconds before looking again, default 3; never a job deadline\"},\"ai_callback_pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Regex on unseen output\"},\"max_output_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Inline output byte cap, default 16384\"}},\"required\":[]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"List only your owned children and their explicit submission or failure state.\",\"name\":\"agents_status\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{}},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Stop and remove one owned child recursively. Its saved conversation remains for a later spawn with the same ID.\",\"name\":\"shutdown_agent\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"agent_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"agent_id\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Ask your parent (or the human for a root agent) a question and wait for a reply. This does not submit your work. If backgrounded, wait_for_job retrieves the reply.\",\"name\":\"send_message_to_parent\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"content\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"ai_callback_delay\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Seconds before looking again, default 3; never a job deadline\"},\"ai_callback_pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Regex on unseen output\"},\"max_output_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Inline output byte cap, default 16384\"}},\"required\":[\"content\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Answer a question sent by one of your children. Omit message_id only when that child has one pending question.\",\"name\":\"respond_to_parent_message\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"agent_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"message_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"response\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"agent_id\",\"response\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Finish your task with a result. Rejected while children remain unfinished: join them or shut them down first.\",\"name\":\"submit\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"result\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"result\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Load an available skill and its dependencies. Appends its instructions to context and enables its tools.\",\"name\":\"load_skill\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"name\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Mark a loaded skill for removal at the next compaction. Its tools stop now; instructions remain until then.\",\"name\":\"unload_skill\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"name\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"}],\"type\":\"namespace\"}]}","event":"request"}
{"data":"{\"include\":[\"reasoning.encrypted_content\"],\"input\":[{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"You are a coding assistant. Use the available tools to inspect facts before\\nclaiming results. Available skills: gui-debug, web-search.\\n\\nFor delegated work, ask questions with send_message_to_parent and answer child\\nquestions with respond_to_parent_message. Join or shut down unfinished children,\\nthen call submit with your completed result. Ordinary text does not submit work.\",\"type\":\"input_text\"}],\"role\":\"developer\",\"type\":\"message\"},{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Work only in /tmp/ch26-live-0N7L6h. Implement slugify.py with slugify(text) that lowercases and joins whitespace-separated words using hyphens; empty input returns empty string. Create a unittest file covering mixed case, repeated whitespace, and empty input. Inspect the directory first. Run python3 -m unittest -v in that directory and submit your actual measured result. Do not create any children. Do not browse or install packages. Use the inherited model.\",\"type\":\"input_text\"}],\"role\":\"user\",\"type\":\"message\"},{\"arguments\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"/tmp/ch26-live-0N7L6h\\\"}\",\"call_id\":\"call_DopDAWoL4ysEVMrc4zMYUpk7\",\"name\":\"list_directory\",\"namespace\":\"ensemble\",\"type\":\"function_call\"},{\"call_id\":\"call_DopDAWoL4ysEVMrc4zMYUpk7\",\"output\":\"agents/\\napi.log\\ndebug.log\\nensemble.json\\ngui.log\\n\",\"type\":\"function_call_output\"},{\"arguments\":\"{\\\"content\\\":\\\"def slugify(text):\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"Lowercase text and join whitespace-separated words with hyphens.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    return \\\\\\\"-\\\\\\\".join(text.lower().split())\\\\n\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/tmp/ch26-live-0N7L6h/slugify.py\\\"}\",\"call_id\":\"call_vJqSpk2msJOlbdPhesIlU4G7\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"namespace\":\"ensemble\",\"type\":\"function_call\"},{\"call_id\":\"call_vJqSpk2msJOlbdPhesIlU4G7\",\"output\":\"wrote 136 bytes to /tmp/ch26-live-0N7L6h/slugify.py\",\"type\":\"function_call_output\"}],\"model\":\"gpt-6-astra\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"high\",\"summary\":\"auto\"},\"store\":false,\"stream\":true,\"tools\":[{\"description\":\"Ensemble local tools\",\"name\":\"ensemble\",\"tools\":[{\"description\":\"Report the selected model, last response and session token counts, cache hit rate and derived session USD cost (unknown when prices are unavailable).\",\"name\":\"agent_status\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{}},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Read text with one-based inclusive start_line/end_line. Optional max_bytes bounds the read; job reports cap inline output and preserve the full result on disk.\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"start_line\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"end_line\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"max_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"path\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"List immediate entries, sorted by name; directories end with /.\",\"name\":\"list_directory\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Search files recursively using a regular expression. context_lines defaults to zero. Output uses grep path:line:text and path-line-context with merged windows.\",\"name\":\"search_files\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"context_lines\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"pattern\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"Write text, creating parent directories. Existing files require overwrite:true unless append:true. Append preserves existing content.\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"content\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"ove