{"data":"{\"include\":[\"reasoning.encrypted_content\"],\"input\":[{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"You are a coding assistant. Use the available tools to inspect facts before\\nclaiming results. Available skills: gui-debug, web-search.\\n\\nFor delegated work, ask questions with send_message_to_parent and answer child\\nquestions with respond_to_parent_message. Join or shut down unfinished children,\\nthen call submit with your completed result. Ordinary text does not submit work.\",\"type\":\"input_text\"}],\"role\":\"developer\",\"type\":\"message\"},{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Work only in /tmp/ch26-live-0N7L6h. This is one small bounded coding task. Create exactly one child with agent_id helper and delegate implementing slugify.py with slugify(text) that lowercases and joins whitespace-separated words using hyphens (empty input returns empty string), plus a unittest file covering mixed case, repeated whitespace and empty input. The child must run python3 -m unittest -v and submit its actual result. Do not create further children. As parent use get_sub_agent_status and wait_for_agent_change to monitor helper, then join_agents and get_submission. Independently rerun the tests, write fleet-result.txt containing your measured test outcome, and submit a concise final result beginning CH26_LIVE_COMPLETE. Use the inherited model. Do not browse or install packages.\",\"type\":\"input_text\"}],\"role\":\"user\",\"type\":\"message\"},{\"arguments\":\"{\\\"agent_id\\\":\\\"helper\\\",\\\"task\\\":\\\"Work only in /tmp/ch26-live-0N7L6h. Implement slugify.py with slugify(text) that lowercases and joins whitespace-separated words using hyphens; empty input returns empty string. Create a unittest file covering mixed case, repeated whitespace, and empty input. Inspect the directory first. Run python3 -m unittest -v in that directory and submit your actual measured result. Do not create any children. Do not browse or install packages. Use the inherited model.\\\"}\",\"call_id\":\"call_9FYrlYV3kXzf7kyc9FdcHueI\",\"name\":\"spawn_sub_agent\",\"namespace\":\"ensemble\",\"type\":\"function_call\"},{\"call_id\":\"call_9FYrlYV3kXzf7kyc9FdcHueI\",\"output\":\"{\\\"activity\\\":{\\\"phase\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"input\\\":0,\\\"cache_write\\\":0,\\\"cache_read\\\":0,\\\"output\\\":0},\\\"agent_id\\\":\\\"helper\\\",\\\"state\\\":\\\"running\\\"}\",\"type\":\"function_call_output\"},{\"arguments\":\"{\\\"agent_id\\\":\\\"helper\\\"}\",\"call_id\":\"call_MjWDv23W6f02izk6N1F6G9RN\",\"name\":\"get_sub_agent_status\",\"namespace\":\"ensemble\",\"type\":\"function_call\"},{\"call_id\":\"call_MjWDv23W6f02izk6N1F6G9RN\",\"output\":\"{\\\"activity\\\":{\\\"phase\\\":\\\"thinking\\\"},\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"input\\\":1962,\\\"cache_write\\\":0,\\\"cache_read\\\":0,\\\"output\\\":29},\\\"agent_id\\\":\\\"helper\\\",\\\"state\\\":\\\"running\\\"}\",\"type\":\"function_call_output\"},{\"arguments\":\"{\\\"agent_ids\\\":[\\\"helper\\\"],\\\"ai_callback_delay\\\":1,\\\"timeout_seconds\\\":60}\",\"call_id\":\"call_IoUORdK2DqXDBbaAqBDsuOUV\",\"name\":\"wait_for_agent_change\",\"namespace\":\"ensemble\",\"type\":\"function_call\"},{\"call_id\":\"call_IoUORdK2DqXDBbaAqBDsuOUV\",\"output\":\"[{\\\"agent_id\\\":\\\"helper\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"change\\\",\\\"status\\\":{\\\"activity\\\":{\\\"phase\\\":\\\"thinking\\\"},\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"input\\\":3978,\\\"cache_write\\\":0,\\\"cache_read\\\":0,\\\"output\\\":106},\\\"agent_id\\\":\\\"helper\\\",\\\"state\\\":\\\"running\\\"}}]\",\"type\":\"function_call_output\"},{\"arguments\":\"{\\\"agent_ids\\\":[\\\"helper\\\"],\\\"ai_callback_delay\\\":1}\",\"call_id\":\"call_KZ7xX2OSmhuLWDgrRhhxknqJ\",\"name\":\"join_agents\",\"namespace\":\"ensemble\",\"type\":\"function_call\"},{\"call_id\":\"call_KZ7xX2OSmhuLWDgrRhhxknqJ\",\"output\":\"job 6 running; 0 bytes total at /private/tmp/ch26-live-0N7L6h/agents/console/io/6\\nno new output\\n\\nUse wait_for_job(6), send_input or kill_job to supervise this job.\",\"type\":\"function_ca