{"data":"{\"include\":[\"reasoning.encrypted_content\"],\"input\":[{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"You are a coding assistant. Use the available tools to inspect facts before\\nclaiming results. Available skills: gui-debug, web-search.\\n\\nFor delegated work, ask questions with send_message_to_parent and answer child\\nquestions with respond_to_parent_message. Join or shut down unfinished children,\\nthen call submit with your completed result. Ordinary text does not submit work.\",\"type\":\"input_text\"}],\"role\":\"developer\",\"type\":\"message\"},{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Work only in /tmp/ch26-live-0N7L6h. This is one small bounded coding task. Create exactly one child with agent_id helper and delegate implementing slugify.py with slugify(text) that lowercases and joins whitespace-separated words using hyphens (empty input returns empty string), plus a unittest file covering mixed case, repeated whitespace and empty input. The child must run python3 -m unittest -v and submit its actual result. Do not create further children. As parent use get_sub_agent_status and wait_for_agent_change to monitor helper, then join_agents and get_submission. Independently rerun the tests, write fleet-result.txt containing your measured test outcome, and submit a concise final result beginning CH26_LIVE_COMPLETE. Use the inherited model. Do not browse or install packages.\",\"type\":\"input_text\"}],\"role\":\"user\",\"type\":\"message\"},{\"arguments\":\"{\\\"agent_id\\\":\\\"helper\\\",\\\"task\\\":\\\"Work only in /tmp/ch26-live-0N7L6h. Implement slugify.py with slugify(text) that lowercases and joins whitespace-separated words using hyphens; empty input returns empty string. Create a unittest file covering mixed case, repeated whitespace, and empty input. Inspect the directory first. Run python3 -m unittest -v in that directory and submit your actual measured result. Do not create any children. Do not browse or install packages. Use the inherited model.\\\"}\",\"call_id\":\"call_9