e stay on disk; a running report is a handle, not cancellation. ai_callback_delay is seconds (default 3); pattern matches unseen output; max_output_bytes defaults to 16384.\",\"name\":\"run_command\",\"output_schema\":null,\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"command\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"cwd\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"ai_callback_delay\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Seconds before looking again, default 3; never a job deadline\"},\"ai_callback_pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Regex on unseen output\"},\"max_output_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Inline output byte cap, default 16384\"}},\"required\":[\"command\"]},\"strict\":false},{\"type\":\"function\",\"description\":\"Wait for a job, including a finished job. Return only unseen output; waiting does not stop execution.\",\"name\":\"wait_for_job\",\"output_schema\":null,\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"handle\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"ai_callback_delay\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Seconds before looking again, default 3; never a job deadline\"},\"ai_callback_pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Regex on unseen output\"},\"max_output_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Inline output byte cap, default 16384\"}},\"required\":[\"handle\"]},\"strict\":false},{\"type\":\"function\",\"description\":\"Checkpoint at a completed micro-goal. Write text with what succeeded, what failed, source locations and next steps. Removes all tool traffic but preserves conversation and this note.\",\"name\":\"micro_handoff\",\"output_schema\":null,\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"text\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"text\"]},\"strict\":false},{\"type\":\"function\",\"description\":\"Keep the previous batch of tool results instead of automatic stubbing on supported models. Does not keep results of tools called alongside this call.\",\"name\":\"keep_tool_results\",\"output_schema\":null,\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{}},\"strict\":false},{\"type\":\"function\",\"description\":\"Wait for owned children to change, exit, ask a question, match output pattern, or stop progressing. Empty agent_ids means all children.\",\"name\":\"wait_for_agent_change\",\"output_schema\":null,\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"agent_ids\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"timeout_seconds\":{\"type\":\"number\"},\"stuck_seconds\":{\"type\":\"number\"},\"ai_callback_delay\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Seconds before looking again, default 3; never a job deadline\"},\"ai_callback_pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Regex on unseen output\"},\"max_output_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Inline output byte cap, default 16384\"}},\"required\":[]},\"strict\":false},{\"type\":\"function\",\"description\":\"Send live steering to an owned child (hint when busy, new turn when idle). Return finalized output since cursor.\",\"name\":\"send_message\",\"output_schema\":null,\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"agent_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"content\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"cursor\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"ai_callback_delay\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Seconds before looking again, default 3; never a job deadline\"},\"ai_callback_pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Regex on unseen output\"},\"max_output_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Inline output byte cap, default 16384\"}},\"required\":[\"agent_id\",\"content\"]},\"strict\":false},{\"type\":\"function\",\"description\":\"Wait for new finalized child output after cursor, or return when idle. Cursor is local to this child.\",\"name\":\"wait_for_agent\",\"output_schema\":null,\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"agent_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"cursor\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"ai_callback_delay\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Seconds before looking again, default 3; never a job deadline\"},\"ai_callback_pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Regex on unseen output\"},\"max_output_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Inline output byte cap, default 16384\"}},\"required\":[\"agent_id\"]},\"strict\":false},{\"type\":\"function\",\"description\":\"Queue a separate question to an owned child and wait for that turn's result.\",\"name\":\"ask_agent\",\"output_schema\":null,\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"agent_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"content\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"cursor\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"ai_callback_delay\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Seconds before looking again, default 3; never a job deadline\"},\"ai_callback_pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Regex on unseen output\"},\"max_output_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Inline output byte cap, default 16384\"}},\"required\":[\"agent_id\",\"content\"]},\"strict\":false},{\"type\":\"function\",\"description\":\"Read an owned child's submitted result, with durable submit.md fallback.\",\"name\":\"get_submission\",\"output_schema\":null,\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"agent_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"ai_callback_delay\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Seconds before looking again, default 3; never a job deadline\"},\"ai_callback_pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Regex on unseen output\"},\"max_output_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Inline output byte cap, default 16384\"}},\"required\":[\"agent_id\"]},\"strict\":false},{\"type\":\"function\",\"description\":\"Cancel and remove an owned child immediately, including its jobs and descendants; retain saved results.\",\"name\":\"kill_agent\",\"output_schema\":null,\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"agent_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"ai_callback_delay\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Seconds before looking again, default 3; never a job deadline\"},\"ai_callback_pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Regex on unseen output\"},\"max_output_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Inline output byte cap, default 16384\"}},\"required\":[\"agent_id\"]},\"strict\":false},{\"type\":\"function\",\"description\":\"Report an owned child's lifecycle, activity and measured session token usage.\",\"name\":\"get_sub_agent_status\",\"output_schema\":null,\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"agent_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"ai_callback_delay\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Seconds before looking again, default 3; never a job deadline\"},\"ai_callback_pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Regex on unseen output\"},\"max_output_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Inline output byte cap, default 16384\"}},\"required\":[\"agent_id\"]},\"strict\":false},{\"type\":\"function\",\"description\":\"End an owned child's turn while keeping the Agent and other jobs alive. mode now cancels the request; after_tool waits for the next tool report.\",\"name\":\"interrupt_agent\",\"output_schema\":null,\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"agent_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"mode\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"now\",\"after_tool\"]},\"ai_callback_delay\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Seconds before looking again, default 3; never a job deadline\"},\"ai_callback_pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Regex on unseen output\"},\"max_output_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Inline output byte cap, default 16384\"}},\"required\":[\"agent_id\"]},\"strict\":false},{\"type\":\"function\",\"description\":\"Start a full child agent with an isolated data directory. It inherits your model and restrictions; optional model selects another supported model. Children must submit results.\",\"name\":\"spawn_sub_agent\",\"output_schema\":null,\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"agent_id\":